				\begin{document}$${\delta }^{18}{{{\rm{O}}}}_{{{\rm{calcite}}}}(\textperthousand \,{{{\rm{VPDB}}}})=(21.9\!-\!3.16\ast (31.061+{{{\rm{T}}}}({\scriptstyle{\circ}\atop} \! {{{\rm{C}}}}))\ast 0.5) \!+\! {\delta }^{18}{{{{\rm{O}}}}}_{{{{\rm{sw}}}}}(\textperthousand \,{{{\rm{VPDB}}}})$$\end{document}δ18Ocalcite(‰VPDB)=(21.9−3.16*(31.061+T(∘C))*0.5)+δ18Osw(‰VPDB)We converted the calculated δ18Osw-ivc from VPDB to Vienna Standard Mean Ocean Water (VSMOW) unit following Hut116:\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
